WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.090
On the run side: all three tasks succeed,

3
00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:09.638
the reader holds exactly nine read-only
permissions and no secret, every window

4
00:00:09.638 --> 00:00:14.513
picks up where the last one ended, and
every Tier 0 incident has a record.

5
00:00:14.513 --> 00:00:17.346
On the evidence side: no
names in the tracker,

6
00:00:17.346 --> 00:00:22.228
every package verifies with a standard
hashing tool, the chain is unbroken,

7
00:00:22.228 --> 00:00:26.637
the storage is locked, and the period
summary is signed and accepted.

8
00:00:26.637 --> 00:00:31.475
That's the last chapter; the workbook index
lists all eight if you want to go back.

9
00:00:31.475 --> 00:00:32.640
Thanks for watching.
